                ('Google AI Overviews and AI Mode', 'AIO', 'The same, written by Google’s AI'),
                ('ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, Copilot', 'GEO, AI SEO, LLM SEO', 'The same, in an assistant’s sentence'),
                ('YouTube and video search', 'Video SEO', 'The same, on film'),
