        answer='Technical SEO is the work that lets search engines and AI assistants fetch, understand and store your pages. It covers crawling, indexing, speed, mobile layout, site structure and markup. It comes first because a page an engine cannot read cannot be ranked, cited or recommended, however good it is.',
